<blockquote class="uncited"><div>what is force DMO?</div></blockquote>In simple terms, it allows split frequency DMR operation.<br><br>Normally when the Tx and Rx frequencies are not the same, DMR radios assume that the channel is for repeater operation, and changes the DMR protocol to RMO mode, rather than DMO aka Simplex<br><br><br>Note. <br>There has just been a bug report regarding the DMO / RMO functionality,  which I will need to fix tomorrow and release updated firmware<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Thu Mar 28, 2024 10:33 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
